Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:00:56.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:01:01.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我下一次不会轻轻地问了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shan't ask you politely next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.59,0:01:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布洛费在那里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Blofeld?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.55,0:01:06.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开...开...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cai... Cai...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.22,0:01:10.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开罗!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cairo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.68,0:01:14.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.81,0:01:18.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.98,0:01:22.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.74,0:01:24.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到哪里可找到他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where can I find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.70,0:01:26.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马丽...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marie...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.28,0:01:27.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问马丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.91,0:01:30.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.79,0:01:34.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Bond. James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.83,0:01:37.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么事要我帮忙吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there something I can do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.38,0:01:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 确是有事你能帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, as a matter of fact, there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.25,0:01:45.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你说出一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is something I'd like you to get off your chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.30,0:01:51.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恩斯 布洛费在那里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Ernst Stavro Blofeld?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:54.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大声一点 达令 我听不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak up, darling. I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.02,0:01:57.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在到了第四阶段 鼻子部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We now come to phase four: The nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.23,0:02:02.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,依我看来 这是整形易容的最困难之部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my opinion, the most difficult part of a plastic transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.03,0:02:05.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你今晚作好手术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want the operation done tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.28,0:02:07.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 但是… - 没有时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But, ser... - There's no time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:10.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布先生这是很精密手术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, Ser Blofeld,this is a most delicate procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.04,0:02:14.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在今晚!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.13,0:02:28.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让温度保持在80度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep the temperature at precisely 80 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.29,0:03:40.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在玩泥巴 007?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Making mud pies, 007?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.42,0:03:46.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他本来几天之后就可以当我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He "would" have been me in a matter of days
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.09,0:03:49.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你给他机会的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you'd given the poor fellow a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.80,0:03:53.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是可惜 我好想看手术的成果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such a pity. I was dying to see how the operation turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.47,0:03:56.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去拿他的枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get his gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.31,0:04:00.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别动 手举起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it! Get your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.83,0:04:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了他!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.53,0:04:49.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎到地狱 布洛费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to hell, Blofeld.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.27,0:05:21.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《007系列之金刚钻》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.42,0:07:50.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,南非之星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Star of South Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.59,0:07:52.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,未琢磨83.5克拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}83.5 carats rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.76,0:07:54.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,切割47.5克拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}47.5 carats cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.97,0:07:59.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柏夏之王 未琢磨116克拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Akbar Shah. 116 carats rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.52,0:08:01.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在听吗? 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you paying attention, 007?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:04.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柏夏之王未琢磨116克拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Akbar Shah, 116 carats rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.90,0:08:08.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但实在没必要让我们的部门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But surely, sir, there's no need to bring in our section
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.69,0:08:11.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,办这种简单的走私案件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on a relatively simple smuggling matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.66,0:08:14.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但唐纳爵士说服首相不这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir Donald has convinced the PM otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.37,0:08:16.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,容我提醒你 布洛费死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I remind you, 007,that Blofeld's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.24,0:08:18.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.87,0:08:24.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起码我们现在能期望你 做点明白 实在的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The least we can expect from you now is a little plain, solid work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.29,0:08:25.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安 各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.05,0:08:29.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 唐纳爵士现在接见二位 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir Donald will see you now. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:30.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安 爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, Sir Donald.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.18,0:08:34.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这位是邦德中尉 - 你好 邦德中尉 请坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is Commander Bond. - How do you do? Please sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.01,0:08:37.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 雪利酒? -  谢谢 我不喝 医生规定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sherry? - Not for me, thanks. Doctor's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:40.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 邦德中尉? - 好的 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Commander Bond? - Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.56,0:08:43.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说你正在休假中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been on holiday, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.81,0:08:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望很轻松愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relaxing, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.98,0:08:48.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不轻松 但非常令人满意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hardly relaxing but... most satisfying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.03,0:08:52.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干杯 干杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.99,0:08:56.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是索拉利中的上品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pity about your liver, sir.It's an unusually fine Solera.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.87,0:09:00.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我想是51年分的 - 雪利酒并没有年分的 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- '51, I believe. - There is no year for sherry, 007.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:07.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我指的是雪利酒最初的酒基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was referring to the original vintage on which the sherry is based, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.46,0:09:10.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1851年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1851.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.51,0:09:12.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unmistakable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:13.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一点也不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.18,0:09:15.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问你 中尉 对于宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.22,0:09:19.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的专业知识到何种程度?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far does your expertise extend into the field of diamonds?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.23,0:09:24.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自然界所发现的最硬物质 可以切割水晶 令人联想婚姻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hardest substance found in nature.They cut glass. Suggest marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.15,0:09:28.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能代替狗成为女人最好朋友 大约就是这些了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've replaced a dog as a girl's best friend. That's about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.69,0:09:31.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很新鲜听到你有一件事不是专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Refreshing to hear there's "one" subject you're not an expert on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.24,0:09:36.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我最好简短说明一下我们问题的背景\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps I'd better give you a brief background into our problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.12,0:09:41.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全世界百分八十之宝石来自南非矿区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eighty per cent of the world's diamonds come from mines in South Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:45.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大部分掘自地底含宝石之泥土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most are dug out of shafts of diamond-bearing clay
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.84,0:09:47.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,深度可达地底三千尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at depths of up to 3,000 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.71,0:09:53.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个过程从头到尾 是在极端严密的安全系统下进行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole process, from start to finish,is subject to an airtight security system.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.39,0:09:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是必要的预防措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an essential precaution,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.55,0:10:01.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纵然业界深以他们工人的忠心及尽职为傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}though the industry prides itself on the loyalty and devotion of its workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.31,0:10:05.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然安全措施能确保忠心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Naturally the security measures tend to ensure that loyalty,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.69,0:10:09.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如同我们提供的社区及社会福利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as do the extensive amenities and social services we provide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.90,0:10:12.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有长驻之医生及护士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a permanent staff of doctors, nurses,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.86,0:10:14.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至牙医\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even dentists.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.53,0:10:19.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个过程从头至尾 是在极端严密的安全系统下进行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole process, from start to finish,is subject to an airtight security system.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.29,0:10:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是必要的预先防范\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a necessary precaution,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.96,0:10:24.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纵然业界深以他们工人忠心及尽职为傲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}though the industry prides itself on the loyalty and devotion of its workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:27.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一位!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.42,0:10:33.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毒虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The scorpion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.97,0:10:36.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是自然界最棒的杀手 温特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother nature's finest killer, Mr Wint.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.64,0:10:41.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向大师学习永远不晚 其特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One is never too old to learn from a master, Mr Kidd.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.87,0:11:06.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医生 晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr Tynan? Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.34,0:11:08.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁? 乔呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you? And where is Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.59,0:11:10.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔今晚不能来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Joe couldn't make it tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.76,0:11:12.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是温特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Mr Wint.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.72,0:11:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位是其特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Mr Kidd.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.35,0:11:20.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.28,0:11:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.45,0:11:39.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的智齿 还没拔掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my wisdom teeth.I haven't had 'em out yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.58,0:11:41.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你看一下好吗? 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you mind having a look, Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.00,0:11:43.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.67,0:11:45.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会弄痛你的 张开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going to hurt you. Just open.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.96,0:11:49.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 再张大一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. Open wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.39,0:12:02.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Curious
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.56,0:12:07.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碰那些宝石的人似乎都难逃一死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how everyone who touches those diamonds seems to... die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.29,0:12:23.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 站住 你们是谁? - 医生派我们来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stop right there! Who are you? - Dr Tynan sent us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.46,0:12:26.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他自己为何不来? - 他生病了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why didn't he come himself? - He was taken sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.67,0:12:28.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被虫咬了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bitten by the bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.84,0:12:32.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他送这个给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He sent this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.48,0:12:44.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果上帝要让人飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If God had wanted man to fly...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.64,0:12:50.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会给人双翼的 其特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would have given him wings, Mr Kidd.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.12,0:13:00.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然 没有安全系统是完美的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No security system is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.91,0:13:03.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都接受有走私带出的可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've always accepted a percentage of smuggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.12,0:13:08.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这二年来 纵然我们有一切防范措施 走私率却高升得惊人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But over the past two years, despite all our precautions, it's gone up alarmingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.21,0:13:11.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更惊人的是 失踪之宝石没有一个出现在市场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And none of the stones have reached the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.17,0:13:14.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唐纳爵士怀疑有人屯积\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir Donald thinks someone's stockpiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.88,0:13:19.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们更担心的是有人可能要卖宝石 降低价钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our concern is that someone might dump them on the market to depress prices or...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.18,0:13:22.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不就是以此向你们永远威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make you agree to perpetual blackmail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.89,0:13:26.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得正是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.10,0:13:28.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要知道是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we need to know is
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.77,0:13:31.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁在屯积\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who the stockpilers are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.61,0:13:33.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,U这个字母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The letter U
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.36,0:13:35.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是雨伞的第一个字母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is for umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.32,0:13:37.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们带着伞 以防下雨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We take it lest it rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.49,0:13:39.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望我们到家前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We hope we shan't want it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.74,0:13:41.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会没伞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}till we're home again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.91,0:13:43.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二个男人来见你 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two men to see you, missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.08,0:13:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是男士 乔苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, Joshua.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.25,0:13:51.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很快就回来 孩子们 乔苏会念故事书给你们听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shan't be long, children.Joshua is going to read you a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.63,0:13:54.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴再度见到你们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How nice to see you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:56.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这次去哪里? - 阿姆斯特丹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where to this time? - Amsterdam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.01,0:13:58.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿母斯特丹! 太好了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Amsterdam! Oh, how lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.18,0:14:03.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以替孩子们带回运河的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall have to bring back some pictures of the canals for the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.56,0:14:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask, and ye shall receive, Mrs Whistler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.52,0:14:12.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天的课就到此结束 男士们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thus endeth the lesson for today, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.11,0:14:17.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,南非最近数件谋杀案让事情更加复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Several recent murders in South Africa have complicated matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.37,0:14:20.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们在我们发现他们前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they shut down operations before we discover them...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.70,0:14:22.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结束作业对我们将是个灾难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be catastrophic for us
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.87,0:14:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对政府也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and for the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.08,0:14:30.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我一直很想到南非 - 你要去荷兰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I've always fancied a trip to South Africa. - You're going to Holland.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.59,0:14:34.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们跟踪一走私犯许久了 - 他叫彼得.法蓝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For some time we've had our eyes on a smuggler  - Peter Franks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.30,0:14:36.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要前往阿母斯特丹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's due to leave for Amsterdam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.43,0:14:38.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道他的接货人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we know who his contacts are?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.55,0:14:43.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不在时我们仍然工作 中尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do function in your absence, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.19,0:14:49.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,护照 先生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Passport, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.36,0:14:54.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法蓝先生 护照室有你的口信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Franks. There's a message for you at Passport Control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:56.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边那道门 你可以把车停在外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That door over there.you can park outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:15:00.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.02,0:15:26.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法蓝先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Franks...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.15,0:15:29.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的护照没有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your passport is quite in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.40,0:15:32.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何人看你这身穿着 马丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone seeing you in that outfit, Moneypenny
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.32,0:15:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定不舍得离开呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would certainly be discouraged from leaving the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.65,0:15:37.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我从荷兰带给你什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What can I bring you back from Holland?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.91,0:15:39.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A diamond?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.70,0:15:42.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装饰在戒指上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a ring
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:48.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,金香花如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you settle for a tulip?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.88,0:15:51.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.33,0:15:57.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(水翼船)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.86,0:16:14.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前面是阿母斯特丹最古老一座桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahead is one of the oldest bridges in Amsterdam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.86,0:16:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫无钱桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Skinny Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.90,0:16:18.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桥建于三百年前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was built over 300 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.07,0:16:22.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一对想天天互相见面姐妹所建\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by two sisters who wanted to visit each other every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.33,0:16:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不幸的是 他们用尽了钱 所以这座桥叫无钱桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately they ran out of money. So that is why it is called the Skinny Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.25,0:16:29.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在各位右手边漂亮的路边房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On your right,those beautiful old houses
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.13,0:16:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可见于我国知名画家林布兰画中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can be seen in the paintings of our famous painter, Rembrandt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.05,0:16:35.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们沿阿母斯特丹河而下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.22,0:16:42.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请大家看左边你们可以看到…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you will look to your left as we go down the Amstel, you can see...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.31,0:16:54.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伟太太说要带运河照片给孩子看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs Whistler did want some pictures of the canals for the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.78,0:16:57.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真好 其特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How kind of you, Mr Kidd.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.53,0:17:01.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们一定很惊喜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The children will be so thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:26.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.56,0:17:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 法蓝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Franks. Peter Franks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.73,0:17:31.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上来 三楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come up. Third floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.42,0:17:53.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要客气 我马上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make yourself at home! I'll be out in a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.09,0:17:59.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己倒酒喝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help yourself to a drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.26,0:18:01.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯斯先生在吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Mr Case not at home?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.43,0:18:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有凯斯先生 T是指帝凡内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no Mr Case. The T is for Tiffany.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.68,0:18:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帝凡内.凯斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tiffany Case?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.85,0:18:10.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确不同凡响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely distinctive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.02,0:18:13.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在那里出生的 在一楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was born there, on the first floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.44,0:18:16.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妈正在物色结婚戒指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while my mother was looking for a wedding ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.44,0:18:21.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我替你高兴幸好不是凡克里阿皮特店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad for your sake it wasn't Van Cleef and Arpels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.91,0:18:26.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我进来时你不是金发吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weren't you a blonde when I came in?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.58,0:18:28.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.54,0:18:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我常会注意这类小事 一个女孩是金发还是黑发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tend to notice little things like that. Whether a girl is a blonde or a brunette.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.25,0:18:36.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢那一个呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And which do you prefer?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.38,0:18:38.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要颜色和衣服搭配得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Providing the collars and cuffs match...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.18,0:18:41.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们等一下再谈这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll talk about that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.34,0:18:43.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把杯子给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me have your glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.51,0:18:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我替你加冰块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get you some ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.38,0:19:18.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你老是穿得这种几乎不蔽体衣服很不赖 我赞同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's quite a nice little nothing you're almost wearing. I approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.67,0:19:20.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我穿衣不用人意见的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't dress for the hired help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.84,0:19:24.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看你的护照 法蓝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see your passport, Franks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,职业 运输顾问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Occupation: Transport consultant?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.35,0:19:30.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太可爱了一点吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a little cute, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.10,0:19:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我去穿完衣服 - 没关系 请不要为了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll finish dressing. - Please don't. Not on my account.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.03,0:20:20.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不太喜欢红发 很可怕的气质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care much for redheads. Terrible tempers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.36,0:20:22.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但它却适合你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But somehow it seems to suit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.53,0:20:24.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来的头发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.70,0:20:26.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但它需要一点温和的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it is in need of some soft lighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.08,0:20:30.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 而我知道一家小餐厅… - 我从不把公事和玩乐混在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know a little restaurant... - I never mix business with pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:32.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我也一样 - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Neither do I. - Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:37.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,言归正传了把你的玩笑话留到把宝石安全送到洛杉矶再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then save the cute remarks until after you get the diamonds into Los Angeles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.13,0:20:41.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 宝石现在在那里? - 那不是你的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are they now? - That's not your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:43.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的问题是把宝石弄进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your problem is getting them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.43,0:20:45.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 有多少? - 五万卡拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How much is there? - 50,000 carats.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.01,0:20:51.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以142卡拉为一央斯 这可是相当大数量的宝石 这可不简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At 142 carats an ounce, that's an awful lot of ice. That won't be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.56,0:20:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以才付你五万元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you're being paid 50 grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.15,0:20:57.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为会是什么? 一付耳圈?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you think it was going to be? A pair of earrings?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.82,0:21:03.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有 法蓝 看在老天分上 想一点新鲜的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, Franks, for God's sakes, come up with something original.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.66,0:21:10.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得佩服你 Q 非常高明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to hand it to you, Q. Quite ingenious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.12,0:21:14.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是个小构想很容易就想出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An obvious little notion. Thought it might come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.92,0:21:19.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 M一直想联络你 那个彼得.法蓝逃走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}M's been trying to get in touch with you. That Peter Franks fellow's escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.01,0:21:23.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在往伦敦的路上杀了一名警卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killed one of the guards on the way up to London.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.05,0:21:26.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.56,0:21:27.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.68,0:21:31.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还在听吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.58,0:21:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么事? - 彼得.法蓝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes? - Peter Franks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.75,0:21:54.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Third floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.92,0:21:58.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 晚安 - 晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Guten Abend. - Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.30,0:22:00.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bitte.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.93,0:22:04.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是英国人? - 对 我是英国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are English? - Yes, I'm English.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.39,0:22:07.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会说英语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I speak English.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.98,0:22:13.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你是那一楼? - 三楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who is... your floor? - Three, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.21,0:24:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他死了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.05,0:24:42.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真心希望如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sincerely hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.68,0:24:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他是谁? - 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who is he? - No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.85,0:24:55.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟踪了我一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This chap's been following me all day today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.11,0:25:01.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.90,0:25:05.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've just killed James Bond!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.16,0:25:10.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是他呀?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that who it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.33,0:25:13.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这证明没人是打不倒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just proves no one's indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.41,0:25:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能杀了邦德 坐等警察来呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't kill James Bond and wait around for the cops to arrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.25,0:25:19.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得快把宝石弄走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got to get those diamonds out of here fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.21,0:25:23.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.05,0:25:29.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天早上一个老太太送来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little old lady dropped them by yesterday morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.31,0:25:32.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无价之宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Priceless.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.52,0:25:38.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想应该让邦德先生替我们送货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we ought to let Mr Bond carry the load from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.24,0:25:51.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是好笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.00,0:25:56.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个人有许多话要对他兄弟说时 结果总是太迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the things one wanted to say to one's brother... when it's all too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.42,0:25:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我再次致上我最深的慰问之意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me assure you of our deepest condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.25,0:26:03.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你登\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you please board the aircraft?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.17,0:26:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们一向分不开的 - 请登机 法蓝先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We were inseparable, you know. - Please, Mr Franks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.18,0:26:16.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞往洛杉矶 之LH450班将起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lufthansa announce the departure of flight LH450 to Los Angeles.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.07,0:26:22.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请系安全带 升空前勿抽烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please fasten your seat belts, and no smoking until airborne.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.94,0:26:26.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.66,0:26:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都上来了 凯斯小姐确实很迷人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're both aboard. I must say, Miss Case seems quite attractive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.66,0:26:34.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以一个女人来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.50,0:26:43.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从阿姆斯特丹的LH450班飞机将抵达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lufthansa announce the arrival of flight LH450 from Amsterdam...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.22,0:26:46.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 法蓝先生? - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr Franks? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.39,0:26:49.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请跟我到海关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me to Customs, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.43,0:26:56.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彼得.法蓝 杰瑞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter Franks, Jerry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.24,0:27:08.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吃午餐吧! 杰瑞我来接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get some lunch, Jerry. I'll take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.37,0:27:11.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请拿出死亡证明书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death certificate, please, Mr Franks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.04,0:27:16.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非利.赖特 你这骗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well, well! Felix Leiter, you old fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.54,0:27:21.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谨代表CIA欢迎来美国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On behalf of the CIA, welcome to America.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.71,0:27:26.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人派车来接你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone sent their brain trust down to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.18,0:27:36.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我放弃 我知道宝石在身体中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give up. I know the diamonds are in the body,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.35,0:27:38.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but where?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.27,0:27:41.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消化管 赖特医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alimentary, Dr Leiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.65,0:27:46.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见 詹姆斯 保持联络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So long, James. Keep in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.78,0:27:53.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你其他的行李检查好了 好了 各位!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rest of your luggage has been cleared, Mr Franks. OK, fellas!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.56,0:28:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想坐在前座吗? 法蓝先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna sit in the front, Mr Franks?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.35,0:28:19.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前面空位比较大 法蓝先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a lot smoother ride in the front, Mr Franks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.36,0:28:23.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 我坐前面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I believe I'll sit in front.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.71,0:28:46.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那死人… 后座的死者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stiff... "deceased" back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.59,0:28:48.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你弟弟吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your brother, Mr Franks?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.76,0:28:50.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.93,0:28:54.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也有弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a brudder.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.64,0:28:58.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界真小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Small world.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.75,0:29:22.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法蓝先生 我是莫顿.史浪博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Franks, I'm Morton Slumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.92,0:29:27.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这令人难过的时刻请接受我诚心的慰问之意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please accept my heartfelt condolences at this most difficult hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.51,0:29:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是走向更好的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is heading for a better world, Mr Slumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.85,0:29:33.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想到这一点令人感到心慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is some consolation in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.93,0:29:38.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么现在 准备让死者作最后之旅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now then, if we're ready to begin the final journey...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.97,0:30:13.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愿他灵魂安息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May his soul rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.76,0:30:15.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 阿门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes. Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.31,0:30:19.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请跟我到我的办公室 我会把骨灰缶交给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you'd come into my comfortable office, we will bring you the urn.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.48,0:30:23.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴你选择我们史浪博葬仪公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so happy you chose our half-couch, hinged-panel, slumber-on casket.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.73,0:30:26.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你弟弟会赞同这选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure your brother would have appreciated it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.86,0:30:28.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想他一定会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.03,0:30:32.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, be seated.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.93,0:30:57.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回归尘土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ashes to ashes...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.89,0:30:59.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 回归尘土 - 正是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dust to dust. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.06,0:31:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这个时刻…我相信你希望独处静思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At a moment like this, I'm sure you'd rather be left alone, for reflection.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.44,0:31:05.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你设想真周到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most thoughtful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.11,0:31:10.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们替你弟弟选了安静的地方在追思园中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've selected a private niche for your brother in our Garden of Remembrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.36,0:31:14.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是用金色窗布遮住的 你一定能找得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one with the restful chartreuse curtains and Angel's Breath gold trim.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.62,0:31:16.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你认为一切安排得宜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you'll find everything in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.79,0:31:19.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们的安排必是没有问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The arrangements have been impeccable
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.25,0:31:22.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到目前为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.87,0:32:42.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常...感人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very... moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.04,0:32:44.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,令人感动 温先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heart-warming, Mr Wint.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.21,0:32:48.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀的致敬 其先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A glowing tribute, Mr Kidd.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.93,0:33:42.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这下流背信玩诈的英国佬 那些宝石是假的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dirty, double-crossin' limey fink! Those goddamn diamonds are phonies!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.23,0:33:47.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, don't tell me. You're St Peter?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.61,0:33:50.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是圣彼得 是吧 都是珠子 真的宝石呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paste! Glass! Where's the real stuff, Franks?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.40,0:33:54.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的钱呢? 什么意思? 你不会烧掉五万元的真币吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the real money? You wouldn't burn 50,000 "real" dollars, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.83,0:33:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后一次问你 真的宝石呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One last break. Where are the real diamonds?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.62,0:33:59.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我真币\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get me the real money
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.79,0:34:02.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就把真的宝石给你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'll bring you the real diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.37,0:34:04.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去那儿?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you think you're goin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.54,0:34:07.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说热带城旅馆很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear that the Hotel Tropicana is quite comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.84,0:34:10.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的慰问之意 二位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My condolences, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.88,0:34:12.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Felix.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.34,0:34:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切很好 但只有一个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very comfortable. But there's one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.06,0:34:17.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要真货 而且要很快拿到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want the real merchandise  rather quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.77,0:34:21.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Q带着刚刚才到达 我们明早就去拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Q has just arrived with it. We'll be up with them in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.44,0:34:25.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好乖乖地待在那儿 没有必要惹麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'd sit tight if I were you. There's no sense in looking for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.69,0:34:28.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就享受一下 詹姆斯 我相信你知道如何享受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just enjoy yourself, James. I'm sure you know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.03,0:34:32.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 我也许先淋个浴或什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite. I'll probably take in a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.33,0:34:48.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(白屋旅馆 谢地树脱口秀)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.34,0:35:02.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(谢地树)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.95,0:35:16.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到目前为止你们还喜欢吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you like me so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.33,0:35:18.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人家说我有洛赫孙的身材\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People say I have the body of Rock Hudson.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.00,0:35:22.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们见过我大怒的情形吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he ever finds out what I'm doin' to it, he'll be madder than hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.04,0:35:24.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把这些女孩叫作我的橡头宝宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I call these girls my Acorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.92,0:35:29.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实他们是威乐怀特送给我的 他现在正在上面某处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, they're a gift from Willard Whyte, who is upstairs right now
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.67,0:35:32.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用真正的大楼玩大富翁游戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}playing Monopoly with real buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.09,0:35:38.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想打电话给他 但想要找到威乐怀特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tryin' to find Willard Whyte is like tryin' to find a virgin in a maternity ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.81,0:35:42.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像在产妇室找处女一样难 谨代表白屋 我要告诉你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On behalf of the Whyte House, I wanna let you folks know
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.77,0:35:44.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是很差劲的观众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you've been a lousy audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.94,0:35:48.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以滚开吧! 待会见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So get lost. See ya later.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.92,0:36:10.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢地 树\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shady Tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.51,0:36:15.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢地 我们真是仰慕你呀! - 多么有格调 品味!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shady, we just adored your act! - What taste, style!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.26,0:36:17.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有几点建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we have a few suggestions.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.47,0:36:23.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不需要批评家 我40年未改变我的表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Critics and material I don't need! I haven't changed my act in 40 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.77,0:36:30.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住! 不要进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it! Don't go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.11,0:36:34.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没拿到真的宝石 所以我们需要树 活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't get the real diamonds, so we need Tree, alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.12,0:36:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这最令人困恼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's most annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.34,0:36:58.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 下注! - 厢式货车 输家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get down there! - Crap. Boxcar, the loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.06,0:37:02.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 小猫 你都输光了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it, pussycat. I shot the whole wad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.27,0:37:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说怎么样? 到我那边?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you say? Back to my place?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.44,0:37:07.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你人不错 麦西 真的 你人很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a nice person, Maxie. Really, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.57,0:37:12.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你何不去睡个觉? 我们明年再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you go and take a nap? And I'll see you next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.36,0:37:15.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要五千元赌金 不 一万好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I have $5,000? No, make it $10,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.36,0:37:18.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二千元限制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}$2,000 limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.20,0:37:22.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么问题吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there some problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.33,0:37:24.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沙斯比先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Saxby.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.50,0:37:28.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位先生要一万元的信用 二千元限制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentleman wants $10,000 credit with a $2,000 limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.46,0:37:30.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是法蓝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Franks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.76,0:37:32.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彼得 法蓝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter Franks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.05,0:37:35.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法蓝先生有足够信用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Franks' credit's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.64,0:37:40.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 祝你好运 - 谢谢 我要二垒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good luck to you, Mr Franks. - Thank you. I'll have two stacks now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.77,0:37:43.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里四千元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give the gentleman 4,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.94,0:37:45.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.73,0:37:47.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是番帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi! I'm Plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.90,0:37:51.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你当然是了 - 番帝.奥图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But of course you are. - Plenty O'Toole.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.49,0:37:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是取自你爸爸的名字吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Named after your father, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.65,0:37:56.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要我帮忙吗? 我是指玩牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like some help? On the craps, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.74,0:38:00.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你人真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's very kind of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.41,0:38:02.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下注吧! 下注吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming out. Coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.33,0:38:07.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士抛股 女士走运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next shooter is a lady. Ladies are lucky. For the lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.21,0:38:10.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,九 九点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine. Mark nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.22,0:38:18.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七点 女士出局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven, loser. The lucky lady craps out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.76,0:38:22.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来一盘 法蓝先生你抛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New shooter. Your shot, Mr F.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.94,0:38:34.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我是威乐.怀特 - 树死了 转到二号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Willard Whyte speakin'. - Tree is dead. Turn on number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.57,0:38:39.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是彼得.法蓝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Peter Franks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.04,0:38:42.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是十号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hard ten. Ten's the number.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.91,0:38:46.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我押十号二百元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take the full odds on the ten. 200 on the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.50,0:38:50.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,限制金押单数 250元押11 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The limit on all the numbers, 250 on the eleven. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.17,0:38:54.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前玩过这个呢!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say! You've played this game before!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.34,0:38:57.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只玩过一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just once.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.60,0:39:00.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 现在我们怎么办? - 不要拿细节烦我 伯特!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now what do we do? - Don't bother me with details, Bert!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.06,0:39:04.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我弄到宝石就是了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just get me the diamonds!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.77,0:39:11.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你玩得真熟练 就像猴子玩果子一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You handle those cubes like a monkey handles coconuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.03,0:39:15.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 各位 谢谢你们一流的服务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, gentlemen, for such a sterling service.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.03,0:39:17.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你赢了五万元呀!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's 50,000 dollars!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.20,0:39:22.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,减掉给你的五千元 我还有四万五千元 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minus $5,000 for you... leaves me $45,000, and thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.62,0:39:25.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那没什么 真的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was nothing, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.42,0:39:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 彼得.法蓝? 你这人真不赖!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know something, Peter Franks? You're a terrific guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.46,0:39:31.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然有点怪 但人真的很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little weird, but a terrific guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.80,0:39:34.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去找个地方喝一杯如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we go someplace and have a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.72,0:39:37.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝一杯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.10,0:39:41.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想进来 番帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you'd like to come in, Plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.27,0:39:46.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好漂亮! 你这里真棒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How pretty! What a super place you have!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.16,0:40:07.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要等我一秒钟 爱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just give me one second, lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.88,0:40:20.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.39,0:40:26.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕你们逮到我正不是时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid you've caught me with more than my hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.56,0:40:30.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事? 变态者集会不成?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is this?! A perverts' convention or something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.82,0:40:32.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 你不可以这样对我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't do this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.86,0:40:37.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手! 我在这城里有朋友…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop that! I've got friends in this town!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.45,0:40:46.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准确极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exceptionally fine shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.96,0:40:51.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道下面有泳池\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know there was a pool down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.21,0:40:58.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我们谈公事 我想你们是为真的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get down to business. I presume you've come for the real...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.76,0:41:02.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的宝石而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The real diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.86,0:41:21.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安 凯斯小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening, Miss Case.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.91,0:41:28.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉得罪你的反胃朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about your fulsome friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.71,0:41:31.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你一定失去些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll bet you really missed something.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.50,0:41:34.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚也许并不是全然损失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The evening may not be a total loss after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.05,0:41:37.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们何不先谈一谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we talk a bit first
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.89,0:41:39.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.05,0:41:43.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想谈什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you like to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.22,0:41:46.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你选话题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You pick a subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.39,0:41:49.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 宝石? - 好孩子!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Diamonds? - Good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.77,0:41:54.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道宝石在那里? 以及我是否单独行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you want to know where they are, and whether I'm working alone or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.44,0:41:56.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到目前为止很很 继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So far, so good. Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.03,0:42:00.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是一个人 那是跟谁呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if not, then with whom.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.66,0:42:04.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样你好通知你的顶头上司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you can inform your superiors and...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.37,0:42:06.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后取得宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}acquire the diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.54,0:42:07.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彼得!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.08,0:42:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真对你印象深刻呀!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm very impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.25,0:42:13.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你比我预料得要复杂多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a lot more to you than I had expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.55,0:42:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以推测 我是死刑犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Presumably I'm the condemned man,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.38,0:42:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而显然地 你是那顿早餐后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and obviously you're the hearty breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.59,0:42:22.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.93,0:42:27.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不打算告诉我宝石所在 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not going to tell me where the diamonds are, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.85,0:42:29.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么宝石?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What diamonds?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.02,0:42:32.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你迟早要说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sooner or later you'll have to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.44,0:42:34.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们会让你张口的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll make you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.61,0:42:39.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最起码你无法活着离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the very least, you'll never get out of town alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.91,0:42:43.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以解决这小问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can solve that little problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.95,0:42:49.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我很幸运 碰上你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's lucky for me that I ran into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.38,0:42:52.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们对半分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifty-fifty split.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.92,0:42:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拿宝石 我负责让我们离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get the diamonds, I get us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.55,0:42:56.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Us?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.22,0:43:00.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能帮了你又留下来呀!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't very well help you and then stick around.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.76,0:43:04.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们明晚前就能搭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could be on a plane and out of the country by tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.72,0:43:07.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里约...香港...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rio... Hong Kong...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.69,0:43:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认识香港一个很好的交易商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know a good tailor in Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.85,0:43:12.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,香港\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.69,0:43:16.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧! 我去拿宝石 你去拿机票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. I'll get the diamonds, you get the plane tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.74,0:43:18.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 机场太明显了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. The airport's too obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.91,0:43:21.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我安排了汽车让我们离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A rented car should do us fine for openers.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.70,0:43:23.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,设想周全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.87,0:43:28.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且既然你是被监视的人 我去拿宝石 你负责车子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And since you're the one being watched, I'll get the diamonds, you get the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.17,0:43:31.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,设想非常周全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's very good thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.33,0:43:33.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Peter!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.42,0:43:39.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有个感觉 我们会开始有个很愉快的关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a feeling this is the beginning of a wonderful relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.14,0:43:48.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darling...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.73,0:43:51.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去哪里拿宝石?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do I pick up the diamonds?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.94,0:43:57.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最后一次到马戏团是什么时候?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When was the last time you visited a circus?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.61,0:43:59.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马戏团 马戏团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Circus Circus proudly presents
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.78,0:44:04.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骄傲地呈现空中飞人表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Flying Palacios!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.68,0:44:30.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他进来了 - 好 待命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's in the building. - Right. Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.40,0:44:34.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯 下次请站着时选接谈地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, next time, pick a contact point when you're standing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.36,0:44:38.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 非利 如果他溜掉… - 别紧张 我有30个探员在下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Felix, if she gives your men the slip... - Relax. I have 30 agents down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.03,0:44:43.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就算穿上球靴也逃不掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mouse with sneakers on couldn't get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.72,0:45:07.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给麦斯信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give Maxwell his cue.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.14,0:45:09.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是四分卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Quarterback.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.64,0:45:11.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传递行动开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Operation Passover, commence.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.81,0:45:13.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四分卫呼叫泰南\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quarterback to Tight End.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.98,0:45:16.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传递行动开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Operation Passover, commence.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.11,0:45:20.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.90,0:45:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(你何不去玩水球游戏)
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.73,0:45:51.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他上路了 目前为止一切顺利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's on her way. So far, so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.19,0:45:55.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 祝好运 非利 待会见 - 你去那里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Good luck, Felix. I'll see you later. - Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.78,0:45:57.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,租车中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The car rental agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.03,0:46:00.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的小约定?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our little rendezvous?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.36,0:46:04.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为他真的会去? 只有千分之一可能呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't actually think she'll show up? That's a thousand-to-one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.49,0:46:05.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是钱的缘故\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, more like even money.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.24,0:46:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他的忠心和我的魅力在较量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her devotion to larceny versus my... incomparable charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.21,0:46:21.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 你们准备好了吗? 开枪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, kiddies! Ready? Aim! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.68,0:46:26.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你们吧! 今晚我保证每一次有胜利者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did I tell you? Didn't I promise you a winner every time?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.31,0:46:28.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿去 年轻人 如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.48,0:46:33.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 女孩及男孩们再度开始 你们只要抓好了枪就是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boys and girls, here we go again. All you have to do is just take your gun...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.36,0:46:36.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有位小小姐 有位小男生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we have a little lady, here we have a little man,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.11,0:46:39.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一位大小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and here we have a big lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.28,0:46:42.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有点超龄了 是吧! 姐妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a little out of your league, aren't ya, sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.61,0:46:44.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 把枪对准 你们知道怎么作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Point the gun. You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.70,0:46:46.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都准备好了? 预备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All ready? Get set.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.56,0:46:48.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓好等我说开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now hold it till I say go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.86,0:46:50.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.61,0:46:52.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快呀! 大家对准小丑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.49,0:46:57.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一次都有胜利者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody point right at the clown. A winner every time!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.20,0:47:02.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打中它们! 这样才对!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we are! All right! That's the way to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.87,0:47:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看看! 我们又有胜利者了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that! And we have another winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.13,0:47:10.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的小玩具狗拿去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Annie Oakley on the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.50,0:47:13.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛快的一晚! 好痛快一晚!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are. What an eye! What an eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.09,0:47:16.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一等! 我都看到了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a second! I saw the whole thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.89,0:47:19.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,机器预先安排好了! 他是谁 你妈妈不成?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The machine's fixed! Who's she? Your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.56,0:47:23.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的小鬼!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blow up your pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.56,0:47:25.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只赢了一次他只赢一次!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One win! She only had one win!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.90,0:47:28.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该要24次才能赢到那只狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're supposed to have 24 to win that dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.61,0:47:30.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再吵了 好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you give it a rest, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.78,0:47:34.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 男孩女孩们 开始…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, boys and girls! Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.39,0:48:08.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是桑波拉第一次展出 他是全世界最奇怪的女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here for the first time, see Zambora, strangest girl ever born to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.69,0:48:11.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在南非奈洛比附近被抓到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was captured near Nairobi, south Africa,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.69,0:48:15.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是人类悲惨经验的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and is believed to be part of a cruel, inhuman experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.53,0:48:19.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个漂亮的女孩将被锁在钢条的笼子内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This beautiful girl will be locked into a steel cage,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.74,0:48:25.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在你们眼前 他将变成凶猛重450旁大人猿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will change very slowly into a ferocious 450-pound gorilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.58,0:48:29.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请不要动 各位 你们一定要寂静无声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please be very still, ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.38,0:48:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须警告你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must have absolute silence
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.55,0:48:35.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不会打扰桑波拉的转变过程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we wouldn't disturb Zambora from her transcendental state.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.59,0:48:38.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有科学实验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must warn you that in every scientific experiment
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.22,0:48:41.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远只有危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's always a danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.35,0:48:43.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以请注意我们出口在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So keep in mind those curtains is an exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.06,0:48:49.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若有紧急事情发生 快离开这里!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God forbid something should go wrong over here, get outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.44,0:48:53.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在要转变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we start the transformation.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.90,0:48:58.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很危险 请安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very dangerous. Very quiet, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.89,0:49:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的美人 醒来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake, my beauty, wake!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.62,0:49:44.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐你不能从这边走 从另一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, lady, not through there. The other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.91,0:49:49.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快追\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.23,0:50:13.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他没出现? - 非利 不要告诉我你们追丢了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No show? - Felix, don't tell me you lost her?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.03,0:50:17.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们追丢了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost her.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.12,0:50:27.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这地方很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice place you have here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.29,0:50:29.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把衣服脱掉 享受阳光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take something off. Enjoy the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.54,0:50:31.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有胆来这里!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got a lot of guts showing up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.09,0:50:35.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我等了二小时 背都僵硬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Letting me freeze my behind off at a blackjack table for two hours
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.80,0:50:37.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苦等根本不存在的宝石!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}waiting for some nonexistent diamonds!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.13,0:50:42.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的黑假发怎么会在泳池里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what the hell is my black wig doing in the pool?!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.15,0:50:59.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 她… - 死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's... - Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.66,0:51:03.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来应该是你 你是下一位连络人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Supposed to be you. The next link in the pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.99,0:51:06.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.41,0:51:09.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可怜的番帝一定是来找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor Plenty must have stumbled in here looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.08,0:51:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.25,0:51:16.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,南非有个牙医死了 还有阿母斯特丹的那老太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A dentist is dead in South Africa. That little old lady in Amsterdam.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.51,0:51:19.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢地昨晚送命 他们对我失手一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shady got his last night. They've missed me once.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.51,0:51:21.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你是下一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're next.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.51,0:51:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你的接谈人是谁? - 你的口气好像警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, who's your connection? - You sound like a cop...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.85,0:51:29.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你的接谈人是谁? - 我只知道电话中的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's your connection? - All I know is voices on a phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.06,0:51:33.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们替我安排这个地方 叫我等候下一步指示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got me this place and told me to wait for further instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.23,0:51:36.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会发现在水里很难听清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd find it difficult to hear under water.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.82,0:51:39.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 东西在那里? - 你是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, where's the stuff? - Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.49,0:51:42.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是警察 你也不是彼得法蓝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not a cop and you're not Peter Franks.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.33,0:51:45.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不是让人打另一边耳光的人 东西在那里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not the type to turn the other cheek. Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.58,0:51:50.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,112航班即将到达 从洛杉矶来的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eastern Airlines announce the arrival of flight 112 from Los Angeles,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.96,0:51:54.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从第七入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gate 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.08,0:52:26.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.73,0:52:57.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加满 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fill it up, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.99,0:52:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是伯特.沙斯比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Bert Saxby.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.65,0:53:04.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是威乐.怀特的左右手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Willard Whyte's right-hand man.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.95,0:53:09.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到顶端吗? 那阁楼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see the top? The penthouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.00,0:53:13.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说怀特在那上面 三年未踏出一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say Willard Whyte hasn't set foot out of there in three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.17,0:53:17.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人见过他 没有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no one has seen him, no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.80,0:53:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 多少钱? - 这可以付吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How much is that? - Did you pay for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.55,0:53:26.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.27,0:53:37.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卷发 我的收据呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Curly! What about my stamps?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.53,0:53:39.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去那里? 你疯了吗? 让我过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going? Are you mad? Let me by!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.86,0:53:41.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收据 你还没加油呢 可以吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stamps? You ain't got no gas yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.95,0:53:47.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吗 那灌几加伦汽油进去! - 退后呀!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- OK, so shove a coupla gallons in! - Well, back it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.37,0:53:53.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你继续吵呀 小心有人找你麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep leaning on that tooter, Charlie, and you'll get a shot in the mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.67,0:53:55.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快呀! 小姐 开走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, lady, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.38,0:53:59.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 小姐 你赢 你赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, lady, you win, you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.88,0:54:04.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 麻烦一下谁来搬走那车?! - 照他的话!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will someone move that car?! - Do what he says!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.51,0:54:08.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要高级汽油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! I wanted high-test!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.18,0:54:14.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 卷发 我给你机会了 你自己弄糟了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget it, Curly! You had your chance and you blew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.92,0:55:22.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.80,0:56:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 哈喽 - 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.55,0:56:48.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我以前未见过你呢 - 我是赫金谢莫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I haven't seen you here before. - I'm Klaus Hergersheimer.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.18,0:56:52.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 新来的? - 来了快三年 在G单位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- New here? - I've been here three years. G Section.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.39,0:56:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,G单位现在怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are things in G Section?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.65,0:56:56.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是老样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still the same old grind. You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.98,0:56:59.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,检查幅射护层 替换了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Checking radiation shields for replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.11,0:57:02.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 你的呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, where's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.36,0:57:06.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我等你们送来 等了几天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been waiting a couple of days for you guys to deliver them.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.08,0:57:10.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真抱歉 你应该打电话给我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gee, I'm sorry. You should have given us a phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.58,0:57:13.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这里有一个 我常常备用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I've got one here. Lucky for you, I carry spares.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.13,0:57:17.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要一直带着 对幅射不能不小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep that on. You can't be too careful about radiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.92,0:57:20.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得对极 带上这个我觉得比较安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely. I feel much safer with this on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.67,0:57:24.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.83,0:57:50.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁? 要作什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you? What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.41,0:57:52.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是赫金谢莫 G单位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Klaus Hergersheimer. G Section.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.66,0:57:55.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是来检查幅射护层的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just... checking on radiation shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.67,0:57:57.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看 你是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now let me see. You are...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.67,0:58:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦斯博士兼教授 我们的护层没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Professor Dr Metz. Our shields are fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.55,0:58:02.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在出去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.26,0:58:04.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉 很快就好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. It won't take a moment but
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.09,0:58:07.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我必须证实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must verify.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.26,0:58:09.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦斯 怎么拼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Metz. How do you spell it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.77,0:58:13.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,M… 请你走开好吗? 讨厌的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}M-E... Will you please leave, you irritating man?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.31,0:58:16.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,博士 没必要欺负小人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor, there's no reason to run down the little people.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.73,0:58:20.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,G单位也许没你们的工作重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}G Section may not be as important to the operation as you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.61,0:58:22.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们也有我们的工作命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we do have our orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.57,0:58:24.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦斯博士 威乐怀特找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr Metz... Willard Whyte for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.74,0:58:28.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 出去 出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Out, out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.79,0:58:32.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈罗 WW\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, WW.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.75,0:58:36.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 终于来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it's finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.50,0:58:40.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,足够我们完成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite enough for completion.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.76,0:58:42.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很快就能做好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be through shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.92,0:58:46.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 完全没有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No problems at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.26,0:58:50.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.68,0:58:55.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你出去好吗? - 好的 博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now will you get out of here?! - Certainly, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.10,0:58:58.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到我要看的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen everything I need to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.44,0:59:02.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.90,0:59:06.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起打扰 我是赫金谢莫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. Sorry to bother you. I'm Klaus Hergersheimer.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.20,0:59:10.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,G单位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}G Section.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.08,0:59:16.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,检查幅射护层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Checking radiation shields?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.91,0:59:30.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在那里! 岩石后面!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is! Behind the rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.91,0:59:32.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快追\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.92,0:59:35.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是干什么? 业余人员之夜?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this? Amateur night?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.92,0:59:37.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻止他 哈利!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop him, Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.93,0:59:44.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他离开那机器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him off that machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.93,0:59:47.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是玩具 快让他离开月球车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That isn't a toy. Get out of that moon buggy!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.96,1:00:18.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这简直是疯狂!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gone berserk!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.96,1:00:22.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在作什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what do you think you're doin'?!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.23,1:02:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That way!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.24,1:03:08.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么回事? - 快上车!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened? The diamonds... - Get in the car!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.36,1:03:13.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你看到一个人 是个教授 微笑就对了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you see a mad professor in a minibus, just smile!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.34,1:03:34.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布林 接警长办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fred, get the sheriff's office.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.97,1:03:44.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以在下个角落让我下车 这整件事情越来越走样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop me off at the next corner. This is getting out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.02,1:03:48.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你要开始和威乐怀特打交道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you start stealing moon machines from Willard Whyte,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.73,1:03:50.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是再见 祝好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}goodbye and good luck!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.35,1:03:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张 我朋友非利他能摆平一切事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just relax. I have a friend named Felix who can fix anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.15,1:03:58.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他结婚了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he married?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.90,1:04:03.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是那个破坏者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There goes that son-of-a-bitchin' saboteur!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.62,1:04:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张 你有个朋友叫非利可以摆平一切事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax! You've got a friend named Felix who can fix anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.25,1:04:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不幸的是 怀特也能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, so can Willard Whyte.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.01,1:04:28.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的混球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, you dirty...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.20,1:06:51.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回答 赖瑞 赖瑞?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in, Larry. Larry?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.41,1:06:52.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赖瑞?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Larry?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.00,1:06:56.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你抓到了他吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you get him, Larry?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.67,1:06:58.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想赖瑞抓到了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think Larry got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.84,1:07:00.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 警长... - 赖瑞 回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sheriff... - Attaboy, Larry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.00,1:07:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回答 赖瑞?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in. Larry?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.75,1:07:05.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sheriff...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.10,1:07:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在逮到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.81,1:07:27.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斜背着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lean over.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.17,1:08:01.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darling...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.93,1:08:05.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们为何在白屋旅馆新婚套房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are we suddenly staying in the bridal suite of the Whyte House?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.18,1:08:09.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,象征我们的合作无间 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In order to form a more perfect union, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.56,1:08:11.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.18,1:08:16.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我终于可以叫你詹姆斯了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I finally call you James?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.19,1:08:21.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会怎么样呀?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going to happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.98,1:08:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和你朋友非利提过我吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did talk to your friend Felix about me?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.99,1:08:28.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么说?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.91,1:08:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,20年到无期 没什么很严重的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something about 20 years to life. Nothing important.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.45,1:08:35.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 20年到无期?! - 别紧张 达令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 20 years to life?! - Relax, darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.41,1:08:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这能因情况而异\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on top of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.92,1:08:49.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乔斯夫妇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr and Mrs Jones?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.09,1:08:52.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 登记本上是这么写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, that's the name on the register, Mr Leiter.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.09,1:08:55.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- WW怎么样? - 华盛顿说不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's the score with WW? - Washington says no go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.14,1:08:58.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们目前按兵不动 - 按兵不动?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We sit still for now. - Sit still?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.30,1:09:03.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帝凡内乔斯则预约好了 终身要住另一间旅馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Miss Tiffany Case "Jones" has a lifetime reservation at another hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.31,1:09:05.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,政府经营的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The kind the government... runs.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.64,1:09:07.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很合作 莱特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm cooperating, Mr Leiter.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.06,1:09:09.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.02,1:09:11.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以作证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can vouch for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.19,1:09:15.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非利 这并不是真的白宫 他也不是总统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Felix, this is not the real White House, and he's not the president.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.94,1:09:19.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们干脆就去见他呀! - 总统我倒能让你见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why don't we go and see him? - The president I can get you in to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.57,1:09:23.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是在华盛顿相信怀特是贼之前 我们只能这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But until Washington believes Whyte's a thief, that's the way it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.41,1:09:26.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这同时 我相信你和乔斯太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the meantime, I'm sure you and  "Mrs Jones"...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.37,1:09:28.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能够找出自娱之道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can find some way to amuse yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.74,1:09:32.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有务必别打扰楼上那快乐的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And just to make sure you're not disturbed, I have a man upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.91,1:09:35.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有汉密尔顿就在外面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Hamilton... is right out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.04,1:09:37.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见 詹姆斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So long, James.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.21,1:09:40.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这倒是个改变! - 什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, that's a switch! - What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.80,1:09:45.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三只小猪保护狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wolf being guarded by the three little pigs.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.76,1:09:48.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很快就回来 达令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't be long, darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.34,1:09:50.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.64,1:09:54.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上楼一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just popping upstairs for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.48,1:10:06.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 16楼? - 不 小姐 只到最顶端\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sixteenth floor? - No, lady. Starlight Lounge only.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.57,1:10:11.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 站开门边 要上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, folks. Stand clear of the doors. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.10,1:10:53.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顶端到了 在左边 有阶梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starlight Lounge to the left. Express to street level only, folks.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.19,1:10:59.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 站开门 走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. Stand clear of the doors. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.52,1:13:31.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎你 孩子 我们还等着你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Howdy, son. We've been expectin' you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.93,1:13:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先处理你的私人之事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got any personal business to take care of in there,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.35,1:13:37.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再谈正事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.36,1:13:39.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先我怀疑你带了武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First, I suspect you're wearin' a hog leg.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.07,1:13:44.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你介意站起来 把它拿掉吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you mind standin' up and takin' it off?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.24,1:13:48.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that nice?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.41,1:13:51.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个聪明的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a pleasant fella.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.66,1:13:53.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你进来呀 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you just come on in, son?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.83,1:13:55.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放轻松 别客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax. Make yourself comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.25,1:13:59.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就对了 就从那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good. Right on over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.81,1:14:21.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.72,1:14:24.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布洛费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blofeld.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.68,1:14:29.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安 007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening, 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.27,1:14:32.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,双重危险 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Double jeopardy, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.98,1:14:36.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕你只是杀了我另一个替身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You killed my only other double, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.65,1:14:41.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他死了之后 志愿者 可以理解地 变得很害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After his death, volunteers were, understandably, rather scarce.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.41,1:14:43.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是可惜 花了那么多的时间及金钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such a pity. All that time and expense
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.16,1:14:49.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是提供你一个虚幻的英勇时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}simply to provide you with one mock-heroic moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.04,1:14:57.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是威乐.怀特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Willard Whyte speakin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.79,1:14:59.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 州长 我接到你的口信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Governor. I got your message.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.13,1:15:03.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 要我出席不太可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm afraid a personal appearance is quite out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.84,1:15:07.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会派人送去预付款的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll send a deposition to the committee.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.30,1:15:10.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 州长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Governor.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.89,1:15:12.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一招高明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's a neat trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.80,1:15:14.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个声音器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A voice box, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.97,1:15:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,科学从来不是我的特长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Science was never my strong suit,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.35,1:15:19.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是原理是很简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the principle is easy enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.89,1:15:22.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把人的声音型态及共鸣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's voice patterns and resonance
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.60,1:15:25.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,存入声音记号的小录音带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stored in a small oral-signature tape.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.61,1:15:29.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个小型电晶体的变体 再植入他的颈子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a miniature, transistorised version is installed in his neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.82,1:15:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是他的颈子 我不记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or is it "his" neck? I never can remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.15,1:15:36.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之 这不重要 我们二个声音都一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, no matter. We both sound alike.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.49,1:15:41.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我向二位恭喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My congratulations to you both.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.54,1:15:47.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很不错的小公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice little company.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.42,1:15:50.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆炸物 石油 电子 建筑 航空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Explosives, oil, electronics, houses, aviation.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.92,1:15:52.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也作得很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've done rather well with it, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.17,1:15:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维持得很好 但实际上怀特是很棒企管人才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tried to cut some of the fat off, but Mr Whyte's a splendid administrator.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.55,1:15:59.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公司自己就能运作呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn thing runs itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.51,1:16:01.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose you killed  "him".
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.47,1:16:03.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没这么戏剧化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing so melodramatic.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.26,1:16:06.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是将他予以保存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm simply holding him in cold storage, so to speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.47,1:16:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,防止外界干扰我计划的保险政策\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An insurance policy against any outside interference with my plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.73,1:16:14.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他确是理想的绑架受害者 人们五年未见到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ideal kidnap victim. No one's seen the man for five years.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.48,1:16:16.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以谁会想念失踪的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who'd miss someone who's already missing?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.15,1:16:19.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真聪明 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How clever you are, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.36,1:16:23.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你并未失去你的过人智慧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice to see you haven't lost that fine mental edge, 007.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.07,1:16:26.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请不要有愚呆的念头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't get any foolish notions.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.74,1:16:30.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,认为那飞弹不是实用性的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That missile is not a practical weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.20,1:16:34.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不值得我浪费工夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's hardly worth the effort.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.49,1:16:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟我不知道该杀你们那一位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all, I wouldn't know which one of you to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.75,1:16:40.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们了解你的困境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We appreciate your predicament, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.50,1:16:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们深感同情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We deeply sympathise.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.14,1:17:03.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高明的主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right idea, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.77,1:17:05.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但看错了猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But wrong pussy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.23,1:17:11.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我确实很高兴我们今天的会面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do so enjoy our little visits, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.61,1:17:14.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是不论这将令人多难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However potentially painful they may be.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.88,1:17:17.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次的会面要结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm afraid this one has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.47,1:17:20.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算如何处理那些宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you intend to do with those diamonds?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.43,1:17:22.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常好的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An excellent question.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.60,1:17:26.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是将吊悬全世界之上的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one which will be hanging on the lips of the world quite soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.27,1:17:28.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我要公布这一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I were to break the news to anyone,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.56,1:17:31.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定第一个告诉你 你也知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it would be to you first. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.27,1:17:33.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但时间晚了 我也累了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's late, I'm tired,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.86,1:17:37.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还有很多事要作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there's so much left to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.03,1:17:42.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚安 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.66,1:17:51.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去呀! 去呀! 只是部升降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, go on, go on. It's merely a lift.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.58,1:17:55.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者我该说电梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or perhaps I should say "elevator".
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.37,1:17:59.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In any event, I'm sure you'll find it much more convenient
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.04,1:18:03.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会比你在旅馆外面攀沿要方便多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than mountaineering about outside the Whyte House.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.46,1:18:05.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按L的键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You press L, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.63,1:18:09.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但字可能不是以L开头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The word "lobby" begins with L.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.49,1:18:43.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们第一次就得手 其先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If at first you don't succeed, Mr Kidd...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.29,1:18:46.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再试一次 温先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try, try again, Mr Wint.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.56,1:21:57.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们二个之中有人好难闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of us smells like a tart's handkerchief.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.78,1:22:07.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕是我 味道还未消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid it's me. Sorry about that, old boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.77,1:22:50.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不介意那机器一天坏二次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't mind the cockamamie machine breaking down twice a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.77,1:22:57.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但为何在离最近出口五百码远?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why the hell does it always have to be 500 yards away from the nearest hatch?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.15,1:23:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 查理 这回轮到你扮它背\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Charlie. It's your turn to play hunchback.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.37,1:23:07.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.53,1:23:12.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在溜鼠 但似乎迷了路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just out walking my rat and I seem to have lost my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.75,1:23:17.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是威乐.怀特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Willard Whyte speakin'.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.38,1:23:20.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是伯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Bert.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.21,1:23:24.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.38,1:23:29.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的声音怎么了 感冒了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong with your voice? Got a cold?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.97,1:23:32.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管这个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.14,1:23:35.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚看到邦德在赌场内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just saw James Bond in the casino.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.31,1:23:38.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 不可能的 - 你自己来看吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's impossible. - Come and see for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.39,1:23:39.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.14,1:23:43.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他有一半别人说得那么厉害 我们真得有麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he's half the genius they say he is, we're in for real trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.06,1:23:47.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 冷静 伯特 - 他一定不是一个人行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Calm down, Bert. - It's a cinch he's not working alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.44,1:23:49.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方一定满布警探\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place must be crawling with agents by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.19,1:23:52.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们最好迁走怀特 - 胡说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think we should move Willard Whyte. - Nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.11,1:23:55.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怀特先生在他的别墅内安全得很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Whyte is perfectly safe at his own summerhouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.11,1:23:58.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在城外十里的小山上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on the ridge, about ten miles out of town.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.74,1:24:01.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有点惊奇 伯特 这不像你呀! 会惊慌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a little surprised, Bert. It's not like you to panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.16,1:24:05.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是很不喜欢 和邦德这样厉害的人打交道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just don't enjoy messing around with a guy as tough as James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.08,1:24:09.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管詹姆斯邦德 你马上到那别墅去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never mind James Bond. You get down to that house.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.67,1:24:13.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想怀特先生突然失去利用价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid Mr Whyte has suddenly outgrown his usefulness.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.46,1:24:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 要作得干净些 伯特 - 不要担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do it cleanly, Bert. - Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.75,1:24:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把一切事交给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just leave everything to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.76,1:24:23.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可笑的装置真得有效呢 Q\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That ridiculous contraption actually seems to work, Q.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.39,1:24:25.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次你超越自己了 才不呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've surpassed yourself this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.89,1:24:29.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去年圣诞就替孩子作了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a bit of it. Made one of these for the kids last Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.72,1:24:32.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦斯 我及詹姆斯前往别墅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maxwell, James and I will head for the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.31,1:24:35.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我们一到别墅你就到顶楼去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get set to hit the penthouse as soon as we find Whyte.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.27,1:24:37.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找麦斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me speak to Metz.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.44,1:24:41.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,计划有所改变 要加快在24小时内完成作业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's been a change. Push all plans forward by 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.27,1:24:45.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上到你那边去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm joining you immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.36,1:24:54.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我5分钟上去 5分钟找怀特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me five minutes to get up there and five minutes to find Whyte.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.53,1:24:58.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确信你知道你自己在作什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure you know what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.50,1:25:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十分钟后再问我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask me again in ten minutes' time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.67,1:25:08.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫麦斯准备冲入顶楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell Maxwell to stand by to hit the penthouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.50,1:26:01.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, hi there!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.09,1:26:09.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫班比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Bambi.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.26,1:26:10.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安... 班比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning... Bambi.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.22,1:26:13.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是桑普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm Thumper.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.14,1:26:16.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能为你效劳吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there something we can do for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.72,1:26:19.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能想出好几件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can think of several things offhand but
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.73,1:26:22.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但目前我要找威乐.怀特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the moment I'm looking for Willard Whyte.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.73,1:26:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,威乐呀!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Willie.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.35,1:26:27.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就在那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, he's right out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.11,1:26:32.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那这边就没事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's all there is to it?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.36,1:26:35.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不尽然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.82,1:26:40.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先 我们二个要玩一玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First... we're gonna have a ball.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.50,1:26:47.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者你的班比!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All yours, Bambi!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.97,1:27:06.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又到你了 班比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're on again, Bambi!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.93,1:27:13.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桑普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thumper...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.96,1:28:39.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Felix.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.63,1:28:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会知道 怀特就要被杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Willard Whyte is about to be executed,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.25,1:28:46.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看谁还在这里教换气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and guess who's giving breaststroke lessons.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.97,1:28:51.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 怀特在哪里? - 我还未查到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where the hell is Whyte? - I haven't found out yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.60,1:28:57.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仍然没查到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still haven't found out.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.40,1:29:07.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.42,1:29:32.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联邦调查局?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}FBI?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.13,1:29:35.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 中情局? - 不 中情局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- CIA? - No. CIA
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.30,1:29:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 英国情报局 怀特先生 詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}British Intelligence, Mr Whyte. James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.34,1:29:43.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你遇见了我的二位朋友 班比和桑普\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you've met my friends, Bambi and Thumper.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.47,1:29:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 我们小聊一番\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, we did have a bit of a chat.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.55,1:29:49.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底发生什么事我该怎么办?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's happened to me and what can I do about it?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.14,1:29:54.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们先离开这里路上向你解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here first and I'll explain it to you en route.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.06,1:29:59.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫麦斯进攻顶楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell Maxwell to hit the penthouse...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.78,1:30:14.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沙斯比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saxby.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.54,1:30:17.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 伯特.沙斯比? - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bert Saxby?! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.91,1:30:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他 他被开除了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him he's fired.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.51,1:30:37.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Q先生 你有没有收获呀?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi there, Mr Q. Are you having any luck?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.10,1:30:40.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是蛮有收获的 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm being somewhat successful, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.89,1:30:42.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Q先生 请问你听到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Mr Q. I... I was wondering.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.22,1:30:45.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别人谈起我的事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you heard any talk about me
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.56,1:30:47.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听非利或詹姆斯谈起?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from Felix or James?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.73,1:30:49.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐伯没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.90,1:30:52.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我现在是替好人工作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I'm working for the good guys now,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.82,1:30:56.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我还是在进牢狱的关口 他们仍然要抓我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm two steps away from the slammer if they want me there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.86,1:31:02.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想… 也许你能替我说好话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought... you might be able to put in a good word.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.54,1:31:12.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不可思议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.25,1:31:15.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,依我的电子磁性RPM控制器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An electromagnetic RPM controller.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.04,1:31:18.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直就想试试看 是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Been aching to give it a try. You see,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.96,1:31:22.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利用磁性使压力松解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pressure on the case when the desired symbols appear
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.42,1:31:30.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这会引起内部的圆筒转动 就在适当时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}causes the rotation of the cylinders to stutter at the precise moment needed to...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.18,1:31:41.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要计程车吗? 小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cab, lady?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.44,1:31:51.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看猫吸引了什么来呀!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well, well. Look what the cat dragged in.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.40,1:31:53.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你 凯斯小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm delighted to meet you, Miss Case.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.74,1:31:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好怕这次沉闷的旅行…要我单独渡过呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd so dreaded the prospect of making this tedious journey alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.83,1:32:05.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, Mr Whyte.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.79,1:32:12.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这儿的呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.96,1:32:15.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大约六尺高 扇形的板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About six feet high, with a solar panel.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.59,1:32:19.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 上面是薄的金底画出来 - 给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It had these aerofoils that seemed to... - Draw it for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.51,1:32:21.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦斯博士是你请的人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was Dr Metz on your payroll, Mr Whyte?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.01,1:32:25.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是 但我听过他 从来不是我们这行的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. But I heard of him. Everybody in our business has.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.51,1:32:28.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是世界第一流的雷射光折射专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world's leading expert on laser refraction.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.77,1:32:31.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,致力于和平的理想主义者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A committed idealist to peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.35,1:32:35.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布洛费是怎么让他来工作的 我看我永远不会知道!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how in the hell Blofeld got his hooks in him, I will never know!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.60,1:32:39.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他当初怎么能通过安全检查到这里工作的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did he get security clearance to work here in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.36,1:32:42.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你说的呀 我亲自和你谈过呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From you, sir. I talked to you personally about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.57,1:32:44.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才就认出你的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I even recognised your voice just now.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.07,1:32:46.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我一定告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure I must've told you
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.24,1:32:51.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要保留作业的微缩影片纪录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not to keep the usual duplicate microfilm records of the project.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.49,1:32:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.45,1:32:56.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,汤母 我叫你如何处理这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tom, what did "I" tell you to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.12,1:32:59.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送到笛班勃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send it to Vandenberg, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.29,1:33:03.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快打电话给他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, get 'em on the phone now!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.80,1:33:10.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.34,1:33:11.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定不相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.22,1:33:14.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 威乐.怀特找你 - 喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Willard Whyte for you! - Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.38,1:33:17.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我真荣幸 - 闭上你的荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is a real honour, sir. - Shove your honour!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.39,1:33:23.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我送去那边的卫星呢? - 24分钟前升空了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's that satellite I sent down there? - Blasted off 24 minutes ago, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.73,1:33:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完美的升空 所有系统都正常 预计准时完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect trajectory. All systems go. We expect to enter orbit right on the nose.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.94,1:33:40.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 等一等 发生了事情 - 等一下 怀特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait. Something's happened. - Just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.86,1:33:42.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,扫描器失去控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The scanners have gone crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.53,1:33:47.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 第一阶段分离提早进行! - 这没道理呀!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Premature first-stage separation! - It doesn't make sense!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.29,1:34:00.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备破坏它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by to abort!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.30,1:34:05.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们无法控制它 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't control it, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.34,1:34:06.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破坏它!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abort it!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.59,1:34:07.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's negative.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.22,1:34:12.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能 引导系统被人控制了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't. Something's taken over the guidance system!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.76,1:34:14.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它完全自己操作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's as if it had a will of its own.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.93,1:34:17.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此刻我们什么办法也没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's not a damn thing we can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.60,1:34:21.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们正在努力 我等一下再打给你 怀特先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're working on it. I'll call you back, Mr Whyte.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.40,1:34:29.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管在玩什么花样 现在是你的朋友布洛费在控制了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever it is, your friend Blofeld's controllin' it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.20,1:34:38.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相当多数量的宝石 由光折射专家在操纵着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A vast supply of diamonds manipulated by an expert in light refraction.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.87,1:34:42.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一个经由宝石引动的雷射光束 而假如这整个玩意儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first laser beam was generated through a diamond.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.29,1:34:44.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有其传闻力量的十分之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if old Metz deserves his reputation,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.00,1:34:47.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那这光束可是力量惊人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the power of that thing could be incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.79,1:34:51.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而布洛费掌握着它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Blofeld's got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.71,1:34:55.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 它现在在哪里? - 向北达科州接近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is it now? - Approaching North Dakota.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.13,1:34:58.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警告战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alert Strategic Air Command.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.30,1:35:01.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我接SAC\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gimme an open line to SAC.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.55,1:35:01.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(战略防空中心 北达科州)
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.89,1:35:06.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人员注意 所有人员注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention all personnel. Attention all personnel.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.35,1:35:11.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在是红色警戒 准备紧急程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a red alert. Stand by for emergency procedure.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.03,1:35:32.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,威乐.怀特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Willard Whyte.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.16,1:35:38.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, General.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.25,1:35:46.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一个飞弹意外地爆炸了 在北达科州\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of our missiles just "accidentally" blew up in North Dakota.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.42,1:35:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是什么事 己开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever's happenin', Mr Bond, has started.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.77,1:36:13.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是你来之处 - 怀特先生 是的 华府来电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is this your herd? - Mr Whyte, phone call from Washington.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.82,1:36:15.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 很紧急 - 我马上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Urgent. - I'll catch it in the john.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.98,1:36:17.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 布洛费呢? - 没有踪影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about Blofeld? - Not a trace.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.15,1:36:20.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们发现一个地道 正在调查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found a tunnel. We'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.32,1:36:23.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 帝凡内呢?  - 你不介意我们先找布洛费吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Tiffany? - Do you "mind" if we find Blofeld first?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.53,1:36:27.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走! 我们到地道去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Let's hit that tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.26,1:36:57.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,华府刚接到你那养猫朋友的口信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Washington just got word from your friend with the cat.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.31,1:37:01.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你相信吗? 他拿我们这整个国家当威胁工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you believe that this whole damn country is bein' held for ransom
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.10,1:37:04.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我们明天中午前付赎金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we've got till noon tomorrow to pay up?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.94,1:37:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是这样 我相信你们不会孤单的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's it. Well, I'm sure you won't be alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.15,1:37:10.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一场国际拍卖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An international auction,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.32,1:37:15.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出价最高者能获得核子至尊地位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with nuclear supremacy goin' to the highest bidder.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.41,1:37:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我 要控制那卫星需要什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, what does he need to control that satellite?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.83,1:37:22.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一组简单的控制带输入电脑存库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A simple set of tapes fed into a computer bank.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.70,1:37:24.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们只需要造一个就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All he really needs is a building.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.96,1:37:28.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些带子大还是小?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And these tapes? Large or small?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.96,1:37:30.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任何尺寸都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Conceivably any size.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.13,1:37:34.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从六英寸到一般录音带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From six inches to a cassette.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.80,1:37:37.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假定他仍然用你企业王国作掩护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assuming he's still using your empire as a cover,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.13,1:37:40.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布洛费可能在这地图上任何地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blofeld could be anywhere on this map.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.68,1:37:42.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从阿拉斯加到佛罗里达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From Alaska to Florida.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.84,1:37:44.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从緬因州到奥瑞冈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From Maine to Oregon.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.01,1:37:49.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从德州到加州巴哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From Texas to... Baja California.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.64,1:37:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巴哈?!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baja?!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.69,1:37:56.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在巴哈并没有事业!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't got anything in Baja!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.90,1:38:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,北达科州苏俄发生核子意外事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is still no official explanation
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.45,1:38:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仍然无官方正式说明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the apparent nuclear accidents in North Dakota and Russia.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.99,1:38:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总统府新闻秘书约翰.山那拒绝评论未经证实之报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Presidential news secretary John Fenner refused comment on a report
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.95,1:38:16.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亦即各部首长正在开紧急会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that an emergency meeting of the Joint Chiefs of Staff is in session.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.62,1:38:21.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据信美苏二个互相以热线保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is believed the United States and the Soviet Union have assured each other
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.29,1:38:24.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并无发动任何攻击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that no offensive action has been taken by either nation.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.75,1:38:29.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,另一件在中国发生的核子事件尚未证实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reports of another nuclear accident in Red China are as yet unconfirmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.59,1:38:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们将继续报告…又有两只浅水船在十里外就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two more submarines have taken up position not ten miles away.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.51,1:38:36.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些军机也不会永远静止不动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are those military aircraft going to stand off forever?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.59,1:38:39.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是他们不接受我们的最后通告决定攻击 怎么办呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if they won't accept our ultimatum? What if they attack?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.22,1:38:44.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静 麦斯 这些可笑的虚张声势早在预期中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm yourself, Metz. This farcical show of force was only to be expected.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.48,1:38:47.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 但…用强大力量显示他们的军事肌肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Great Powers flexing their military muscles
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.65,1:38:49.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像海滩上那些无能的男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like so many impotent beach boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.81,1:38:54.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾威胁要摧毁主要城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I deeply regret my threat to destroy a major city unless they give in,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.28,1:38:58.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但除非他们屈服 我也只有这么做了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the nuclear powers, like all bullies, can only be intimidated by force.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.11,1:39:02.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 但你怎能… - 据他们回答时间还不到一小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But how can you... - They still have an hour left to reply.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.95,1:39:07.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再一小时就能达到我们共同的梦想 完全的武装解除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One hour for both of us to achieve our common dream: Total disarmament
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.87,1:39:11.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,及世界和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and peace for the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.83,1:39:14.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 有一架飞机飞近 - 距离?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sir, there's a single plane approaching. - Range?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.17,1:39:18.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两里 继续接近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two miles, and closing.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.00,1:39:20.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发出一号警报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stage One alert, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.09,1:39:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,指挥中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Command Centre.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.21,1:39:26.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实施一号戒备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All crew to Stage One.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.05,1:39:31.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到顶端 第二平台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up the top! Second platform!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.39,1:39:35.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.95,1:40:01.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 发射! - 不要开枪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aim! - Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.51,1:40:22.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有搜索人员 到甲板上 待命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All recovery crew personnel, proceed to docking level and stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.48,1:40:34.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安 各位! 我是污染公害调查员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, gentlemen! The Acme Pollution Inspection.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.69,1:40:40.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要清除污染油源 我们想从这只船开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're cleaning up the world. We thought this was a suitable starting point.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.80,1:41:13.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多么令人失望! 我期望起码是一国首长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How disappointing! I expected one head of state, at the very least.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.68,1:41:16.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说来我们根本不必协商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surely you haven't come to negotiate, Mr Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.51,1:41:19.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的小岛国甚至未被威胁呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your pitiful little island hasn't even been threatened.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.14,1:41:26.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,彻底搜他的身 然后把他带来见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Search him from his toenails to the last follicle on his head. Then bring him to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.29,1:41:53.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真讨厌进行曲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do so hate martial music.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.08,1:41:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正如以往 邦德先生 你完全想对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As usual, Mr Bond, you were absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.92,1:42:02.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你猜对了 那个箱子装着卫星主控带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guessed correctly that that box contained the satellite control tape
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.92,1:42:06.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你上船来 希望用这个代替\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you came aboard presumably hoping to substitute this
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.93,1:42:10.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的控制带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.10,1:42:16.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉破坏你的主线计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So sorry to have ruined the line of your suit for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.64,1:42:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说到线 你是用什么线控制了凯斯小姐?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talking about lines, which one did you use on Miss Case?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:20.35,1:42:22.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯斯小姐对此事采取非常理性的态度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has taken a reasonable attitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.52,1:42:28.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正如同所有明理的人 他只有在被威胁时才威胁我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like any sensible animal, she's only threatening when threatened.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.40,1:42:31.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你是完全当握了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it appears that you're holding all the aces.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.53,1:42:35.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 这位火龙女 - 嫉妒我? 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right down to the dragon lady here. - Jealousy? From you, Mr Bond?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.41,1:42:37.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你让我受宠若惊呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm flattered.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.58,1:42:40.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据我的理智观察:\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As La Rochefoucauld observed:
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.33,1:42:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谦虚是最糟的一种自负\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Humility is the worst form of conceit."
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.25,1:42:46.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的确希望胜利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do hold the winning hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.37,1:42:50.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你何不让我带你参观一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you let me take you on a little tour of our facilities?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.79,1:42:53.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有机会再度看到真的控制带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your chance to see the real tape once again.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.84,1:42:57.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以跟去吗? 恩斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I tag along, Ernst?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.55,1:43:01.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会先在比基尼外面加上衣服的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd put something on over that bikini first, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.05,1:43:04.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到达这个阶段了不能让我的部下到头来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come too far to have the aim of my crew
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.97,1:43:07.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到美的身材而受影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}affected by the sight of a pretty body.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.60,1:43:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是没有任何消息!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No word yet from anyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.73,1:43:12.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只剩十二分钟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only 12 minutes left.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.89,1:43:17.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧! 我想需要一点轻微的刺激了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose a little gentle prodding is called for.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.19,1:43:22.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样 邦德先生 目前卫星正在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you see, Mr Bond, the satellite is at present over
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.69,1:43:25.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯撒斯上方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kansas.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:26.15,1:43:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是如果我们摧毁肯撒斯 世界可能几年内都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we destroy Kansas, the world may not hear about it for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.45,1:43:33.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许纽约如此交通繁忙的都市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps New York. All that smut and traffic.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.41,1:43:36.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会给他们重新开始的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would give them a chance for a fresh start.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.37,1:43:38.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,华盛顿 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Washington, DC. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.83,1:43:42.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然我们没有他们的消息 他们会听到我们的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since we have not heard from "them", "they" will hear from "us".
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.58,1:43:46.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 去办吧 麦斯 - 华盛顿 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- See to it, Metz. - Washington. Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.71,1:43:50.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这大概就是电脑存库 和装密码的带子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this, presumably, is the control bank with the coded tape.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.97,1:43:52.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又说对了 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right again, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.97,1:43:55.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有卫星是由密码带控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All satellites are controlled by a coded tape.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.09,1:43:58.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,秘决就在知道它的密码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The trick is, of course, to have the code.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.68,1:43:59.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,显然是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.22,1:44:06.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这看起来非常简单 只要按这个开关它就跳出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It all seems so perfectly simple. I suppose one just presses that and out it pops.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.52,1:44:11.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把它放回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it back, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.32,1:44:14.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上放回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.45,1:44:20.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Ernst.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.11,1:44:23.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超人给你惹麻烦了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Superman giving you any trouble?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.41,1:44:26.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放回去 小心地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put it back... very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.71,1:44:34.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开始令人厌烦了 邦德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've suddenly become tiresome, Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.33,1:44:36.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目标设定 开始倒数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target fixed! Commence countdown!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.75,1:44:39.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十分钟 开始数了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten minutes and counting!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.67,1:44:42.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他带走 到仓库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him away and throw him in the brig.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.17,1:44:47.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为保险起见 再搜他一次身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And search him again, just to make sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.68,1:44:56.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.10,1:44:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.64,1:45:03.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你担心的问题都丢在身后了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your problems are all behind you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.63,1:45:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop him!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.72,1:45:42.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,9分钟 继续倒数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.01,1:45:48.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做到了 我把带子换过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did it. I switched the tape in the machine.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.81,1:45:51.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这呆女人真的带子又放回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stupid twit. You put the real one back in.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.73,1:45:55.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.74,1:46:17.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,气象气球!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A weather balloon!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.50,1:46:20.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你认为如何? 赖特先生? - 那一定就是信号了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you think, Mr Leiter? - That must be the signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.13,1:46:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这附近二百里内没有低气压呀 我们走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There isn't a low-pressure area within 200 miles of here. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.25,1:46:29.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理一号呼叫飞行小队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Charlie One to Squadron.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.63,1:46:33.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查理一号呼叫飞行小队 准备作战向目标前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie One to Squadron. Ready all guns and proceed to target.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.76,1:46:35.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再说一次 向目标前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat: Proceed to target.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.93,1:46:38.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道 查理一号 完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger, Charlie One. Out.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.81,1:46:41.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油邦德 快脱身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Bond. Get the hell off that rig.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.10,1:46:46.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,八分钟 继续倒数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.52,1:46:52.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身分不明飞机向我们接近 距离 五里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unidentified aircraft approaching rapidly. Range... five miles.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.98,1:46:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不明白!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I... I don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.15,1:46:58.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说他们不会攻击! - 那汽球是个信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You said they wouldn't attack! - The balloon was a signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.90,1:47:02.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些混蛋 一定以为邦德完成任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stupid fools must think Mr Bond has accomplished his mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.91,1:47:06.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 开动防卫措施 - 开动防卫措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Activate defences! - Activate defences.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.71,1:47:22.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七分钟 继续倒数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.43,1:47:33.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是查理一号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Charlie One.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.39,1:47:35.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始攻击!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commence attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.39,1:47:38.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始攻击!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commence attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.25,1:48:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,六分钟 倒数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.55,1:48:14.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用无线电通知他们 布洛费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get them on the radio, Blofeld!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:14.71,1:48:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 说我们投降 - 投降?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tell them we give up! - Give up?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.38,1:48:18.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我等这个时刻等好久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've waited too long for this moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.72,1:48:21.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要为愚弄我付出重大代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll pay dearly for making a fool out of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.14,1:48:25.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在明白了 你根本不在乎世界和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see it all now. You don't give a damn about peace!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.68,1:48:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你只在乎… - 麦斯 闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All you care about... - Shut up, Metz.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.14,1:48:33.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帝凡内 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tiffany, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.40,1:48:38.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天要比平常勇敢 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're showing a bit more "cheek" than usual, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.36,1:48:45.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他带下去 和邦德先生锁在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take her below and lock her up with Mr Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.16,1:48:49.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多么可惜 这么一个美人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a pity. Such nice cheeks, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.57,1:48:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有脑袋就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only they were brains.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:51.95,1:48:55.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毁掉这个 麦斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroy this, Metz.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.47,1:49:13.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五分钟 继续倒数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.13,1:50:09.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四分钟 继续倒数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.40,1:50:32.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他们我们要投降! 这全然疯狂了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them we surrender! This is utter madness!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.28,1:50:37.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再说一句 我就杀了你 回到你的工作区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One more word, Metz, and I'll have you shot! Get back to your post!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.79,1:50:44.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上准备好我的战斗浅水船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare my bathosub immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.09,1:50:56.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三分钟 继续倒数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.52,1:51:13.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有系统设定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All systems interlock.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.48,1:51:17.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,升降机启动浅水船开始作业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bathosub to crane. Commence lift.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.29,1:51:35.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,二分钟 继续倒数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.09,1:51:49.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动力读表系统开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power and breathing systems on.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.26,1:51:52.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,释放装置开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Release catch is open.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.09,1:51:55.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把船降下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lower away.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.76,1:52:01.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快开升降机! 把船降下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bathosub to crane! Lower away!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:01.06,1:52:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒醒 家伙! 把船降下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up, man! Lower away!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.19,1:52:12.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这白痴! 你差一点害死我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stupid idiot! You could've killed me!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.86,1:52:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,松船放开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disengage!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.03,1:52:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,松船放开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disengage!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.41,1:52:23.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,松船放开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disengage!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.12,1:52:28.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,降落! 不是上升!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lower! Not up!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.91,1:52:34.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一分钟 倒数\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One minute and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.50,1:52:37.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布洛费呼叫指挥中心!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blofeld to Command Centre!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.88,1:52:39.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回答!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.05,1:52:42.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布洛费呼叫指挥中心!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blofeld to Command Centre!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.30,1:52:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回答!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.39,1:52:53.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶的家伙!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.64,1:52:57.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,指挥中心 告诉我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Command Centre, come in!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.31,1:53:04.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四十秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}40 seconds and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.53,1:53:11.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.74,1:53:17.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 拿去! - 扫射他们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here! - Shoot 'em!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.55,1:53:34.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跳!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.76,1:53:38.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,十...九...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten... nine...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.96,1:54:26.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见 詹姆斯! 我会通报M 你在回程中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So long, James! I'll wire M you're on your way home!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:26.71,1:54:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要告诉他们我们往那个方向!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell him which direction we've taken!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.55,1:54:31.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们玩得很愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're havin' a good time,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.51,1:54:37.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让船长依着圈子航行!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let the captain know and I'll have him steam around in circles!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.40,1:54:53.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯 有一件很重要的事我一直要问你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James, there's something very important I've been meaning to ask you
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.48,1:54:57.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about us.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.24,1:55:01.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道以我们这样的关系 不该由女孩子来问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know in a relationship like ours, the girl's not supposed to be the one to ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.82,1:55:03.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我忍不住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.99,1:55:05.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有请回答前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And please
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.16,1:55:08.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,务必三思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}think before answering.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.33,1:55:10.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.83,1:55:14.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.63,1:55:28.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一定是送错了 我并没有叫这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There must be some mistake. I didn't order anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:29.10,1:55:31.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有错 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No mistake, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.26,1:55:35.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奉威乐.怀特的指示 以此略表他的敬意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the specific instructions and with the compliments of Mr Willard Whyte.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.14,1:55:41.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新鲜海鲜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oysters Andaluz.Shashlik.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.31,1:55:45.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各种海味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tidbits.Prime rib "en jus".
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.07,1:55:49.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沙拉 欧皮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Salade Utopia.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.40,1:55:52.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至于点心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for dessert,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.78,1:55:57.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,则是比爱思甜点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the "pie de ristance"...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.37,1:56:02.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一道绝佳的冰其淋点心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}la bombe surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.12,1:56:05.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了 里面有什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That looks fantastic! What's in it?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.21,1:56:09.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夫人 那就不希奇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then there would be no "surprise", would there, madame?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.79,1:56:12.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 夫人 要坐下来吗? - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- If madam would care to be seated. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.84,1:56:17.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们马上就好 然后就让二位安静地用餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will just take a moment, and then we will leave you in peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.01,1:56:19.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要酒吗? 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wine, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.93,1:56:22.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,55年分的穆塔洛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mouton Rothschild '55.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.72,1:56:27.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 可以开始吗? - 请问始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- May we begin? - Please do.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.73,1:56:40.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,酒选得很好 是吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A happy selection, if I may say.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.99,1:56:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自会判断\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be the judge of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.15,1:56:46.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,味道很强 不是瓶盖 而是你摇得不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's rather potent. Not the cork, your aftershave.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.74,1:56:50.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强得足以掩盖任何味道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strong enough to bury anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.29,1:56:55.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但酒很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the wine is quite excellent.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.45,1:56:59.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然对这样的大餐 我期望的酒是红葡萄酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Although, for such a grand meal, I had rather expected a claret.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.58,1:57:01.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.83,1:57:07.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不幸是我们酒库红葡萄酒不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, our cellar is rather poorly stocked with clarets.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.26,1:57:11.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穆塔洛就是红葡萄酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mouton Rothschild "is" a claret.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.88,1:57:17.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且在摇动之前不太好闻 闻起来味道冲鼻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I've smelt that aftershave before. And both times I've smelt a rat.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.73,1:58:21.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的确是夹尾巴而逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He certainly left with his tails between his legs.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.23,1:58:24.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 詹姆斯!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, James!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.40,1:58:27.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 你要问我什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes. What were you about to ask me?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.19,1:58:30.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詹姆斯...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}James...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.36,1:58:34.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么把那些宝石弄下来?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the hell do we get those diamonds down again?
